  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>White Caps<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>This marvelous beach retreat is located directly on the beach of the famed Scenic Highway 98 in South Walton Beach. This home boasts a bright and welcoming interior, panoramic views of the Gulf of Mexico from almost every window, a large patio, and a deck. Cool off in the private pool or use the comfortable lounge chairs to sunbathe under the warm Florida sun. You'll love ambling along your private boardwalk to access to the white sandy beaches and sparkling gulf waters.<br><br><br><br>White Caps is located in the quaint beach town of Inlet Beach, near an array of locally-owned shops, restaurants, and family-friendly activities. Put on your best sneakers and explore Seacrest Beach, Rosemary Beach, and Alys Beach for an unforgettable experience; all of them are located one mile, one and a half miles, and two and a half miles respectively. Highway 30A offers its own local flair, so make sure you explore the entire 24 miles of culture and delicious cuisine!<br><br><br><br><b>Things to Know</b><br><br>Outlet covers are available to protect younger guests.<br><br>Parking RVs, boats, trailers, and street parking of any vehicle is prohibited.<br><br>Pool heat is available for $400 (plus tax), must request 48 hours prior to arrival.<br><br>Please note: This property has a strict maximum occupancy limit of 10 guests, regardless of age. All individuals, including infants and children, must be counted toward the total occupancy.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Gulf-front house near golf with pool, ocean views, beach access, & balcony"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
